  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rio Medellin Basic Sanitation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Saneamiento Basico del Rio Medellin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROJECT OBJECTIVE IS TO CONTRIBUTE TO RECOVER THE QUALITY OF THE MEDELLIN RIVER, THROUGH TWO COMPONENTS: (1) CONSTRUCTION OF A WATER TREATMENT PLANT, AND (2) EXPANSION AND IMPROVEMENT OF THE WATER AND SEWAGE SYSTEMS.</narrative>
